+20260704
+	+ add zutty -TD
+	+ modify winch() and winsch() to use wcstombs() to convert 8-bit codes
+	  to Unicode when ncurses is configured to support Unicode but is not
+	  using UTF-8 encoding (report/analysis by Serhiy Storchaka).
+	+ fixes for compiler warnings/cppcheck.
+	+ fixes for scan-build, valgrind build/testing.
+	+ fix a memory leak in _nc_resolve_uses2 (report/testcase by
+	  Yufeng Wu, Zhijie Zhang, Qizhen Xu)
+	+ add a check for escaped nul in fmt_complex (report/testcase by
+	  Yufeng Wu, Zhijie Zhang, Qizhen Xu).
+	+ add a limit-check in _nc_tgetent (report by Utku Yildirim).
+	+ add a buffer-limit check in tgetstr.
+
